*Refining costs different Refining Stones depending on the refine level:
  Lv1 to 5: Basic Refining Stones;
  Lv6 to 10: Mid Refining Stones;
  Lv11 to 15: Advanced Refining Stones and Hero Stones;
  Lv16 to 20: Super Refining Stones and Hero Stones.
*From refine Lv11, failed refines raise the success rate:
  Lv11 to 16: up to 10% per failure;
  Lv16 to 20: failures can at most double the success rate.
*Success boost items: tap the boost button to use items that raise this refine's success rate. Each level can at most be doubled.
*When all equipment worn by a character reaches certain refine levels, Refine Master bonuses trigger and raise the character's stats.

